# Line-ending policy
#
# Normalize text files (sources, JSON, Markdown, requirements, prompt snapshots)
# to LF both in the repository and on checkout, so a clone on any operating
# system gets the intended bytes. JSON writers also pin `newline="\n"`.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The evaluation CSVs are written with a deterministic CRLF row terminator
# (Python's csv module default), so their bytes are identical on every platform.
# `-text` keeps those bytes exactly as stored instead of normalizing them to LF.
*.csv -text
